# The hunt gym's words: the clue to the floating eyes. Every text in <<...>>
# is still to write; replace it, keep the rest.

== note eye_weakness
intent: What the clue teaches, in the Exsecrator's own pencil: eyes come in packs, a single ball won't do it, copal and shot will, and an egg takes the eye off you.
text: <<pencil: what the eyes fear>>

== readable eye_clue
note: eye_weakness
intent: A curandera's note pinned in the kit room, the first clue of the first hunt: the eyes are mal de ojo got loose, envy made flesh. They come in packs and swoop, a single ball hardly marks one, copal smoke or a charge of shot will, and if one has looked at you too long, an egg rolled over you draws it off.
text:
<<the curandera's note on the eyes>>
